			"notes": "- Fixed a crash when handling uncaught exceptions that have not been wrapped into a blunder. (@aurakle)\n- Fixed the mirror evaluation button sometimes triggering when opening the screen. (@hazenebulous)\n- Fixed the book's landing page spell. (@aurakle)\n- Updated a reference to Spell Ink in the book. (@aurakle)\n- Fixed fragment groups in the book not being parsed properly when Iris is installed, resulting in messy and overflown text. (@aurakle)\n- Fixed unlinked dots not showing up for patterns in the book. (@hazenebulous)\n- Fixed circles with many children not showing their children. (@hazenebulous)\n- Made VoidFragment's constructor private. Add-ons which improperly created a new instance of the Void fragment may crash. (@aurakle)\n- Re-textured the Charging Belt. (thanks, crephan!)\n- Fixed a typo. (@aurakle)"
